data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":100,"item_id":"rs_0117c821ec4dcee5016aca792ce044819784dd20d7eac0c45a","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Implementing server static routes**\n\nI’m focusing on implementing a server with static single JavaScript and HTML routes. I need to ensure robust security by escaping content through textContent. I'll write tests for the Node test built-in, and launch a temporary database outside of the repo to test the API. Since no browser is available, I’ll work with SQLite for database syncing. I'll ensure headings are accessible and forms trigger alerts to clear and validate input, followed by an initial fetch to open rows by numeric IDs."}}

